    partOfSpeech a
    synonyms (straight)
  entry
    definition "(geometry) a plane rectangle with four equal sides and four right angles; a four-sided regular polygon"
    examples ("you can compute the area of a square if you know the length of its sides")
    id oewn-13901273-n
    partOfSpeech n
    synonyms (foursquare)
  entry
    definition "the product of two equal terms"
    examples ("nine is the second power of three" "gravity is inversely proportional to the square of the distance")
